		{
			dependencies: ["7361C9AB0E931137"]
			description: [
				"The Alchemistry machines have a unique way of loading recipes, this is because many recipes in these machines overlap, examples of this include coal \\& charcoal, saplings, stone types, and many more such examples. &lBecause of this you must ensure the correct recipe is loaded and \"locked\" into the machine before you \"resume\" its' operations.&r "
				""
				"按照以下步骤操作，可确保每次使用机器时都加载正确的配方："
				""
				"1. 解锁配方"
				"2. 暂停机器"
				"3. 在JEI中查看配方时，按下add按钮即可从JEI加载配方"
				"4. 锁定配方"
				"5. 恢复机器"
				""
				""
				"&l步骤3的重要提示：&r &o你必须从JEI加载配方，而不是机器的配方查看器；机器配方查看器只是个查看器，点击其中的物品不会加载配方。&r &l使用JEI/EMI加载配方至关重要。&r"
			]
